OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 20 MAR
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,G1930FFriday Night is Music Night
OL,8,     GA French theme to a concert
OL,9,     Gfeaturing Radio 3 New Generation
OL,10,     GArtist Julius Asal, who joins
OL,11,     Gconductor Michael Seal and the
OL,12,     GBBC Concert Orchestra in Ravel's
OL,13,     GPiano Concerto.
OL,14,G2145FThe Essay: Scotland Rocks
OL,15,     GScotland has been blessed with
OL,16,     Gthe most exciting of gemstones,
OL,17,     Gbut knowing where to find them is
OL,18,     Gthe secret. Kenneth Steven
OL,19,     Gcombines Scottish geological
OL,20,     Ghistory with his poetry.
